(4173695, 600512, 84283, '<td valign="top">Out of all the photos for this competition, this was the only one that jumped at me and really portrayed the topic. The rest have nice viewpoints, but this shows a real point of view. Great job!</td>', 'Out of all the photos for this competition, this was the only one that jumped at me and really portrayed the topic. The rest have nice viewpoints, but this shows a real point of view. Great job!', '2007-10-17 02:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
