(4173705, 600482, 84283, '<td valign="top">This is also a good example of showing somone''s point of view. It isnt just a shot, it isn''t just artistic, and even though  you aren''t seeing what they are seeing you can see where they are coming from. Great shot.</td>', 'This is also a good example of showing somone''s point of view. It isnt just a shot, it isn''t just artistic, and even though  you aren''t seeing what they are seeing you can see where they are coming from. Great shot.', '2007-10-17 02:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
