(4175102, 600861, 85155, '<td valign="top">Wow that is a nice cloud.  This has a great effect in B&amp;W.  It looks like the pictured could be straightened out a bit though, the horizon looks crooked.</td>', 'Wow that is a nice cloud.  This has a great effect in B&W.  It looks like the pictured could be straightened out a bit though, the horizon looks crooked.', '2007-10-17 12:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175106, 601194, 85155, '<td valign="top">I keep trying to figure out what is in the background.  It is not very recognizable, if you meant it that way, then I think you should have just got rid of it, it is very distracting to me.</td>', 'I keep trying to figure out what is in the background.  It is not very recognizable, if you meant it that way, then I think you should have just got rid of it, it is very distracting to me.', '2007-10-17 12:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175118, 601203, 85155, '<td valign="top">This is a very unique thought.  I like how you stopped the action, and the fall colors really help to make this photo come alive.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is a very unique thought.  I like how you stopped the action, and the fall colors really help to make this photo come alive.  Nicely done.', '2007-10-17 12:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175133, 600123, 85155, '<td valign="top">I think the tilt in the glass would look better if it was going away from me rather than towards me, but I''d have to see it to know for sure.  Nice thought and nice colors in the drink.</td>', 'I think the tilt in the glass would look better if it was going away from me rather than towards me, but I''d have to see it to know for sure.  Nice thought and nice colors in the drink.', '2007-10-17 12:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
