(4175139, 599308, 85155, '<td valign="top">It seems like the main subject is supposed to be the dog, but he is cut out too much, so he doesn''t really seem like he is.  Also the sky and the roof are blown out, there is no detail there it is just pure white.  I think I would try to straighten it out a bit too.</td>', 'It seems like the main subject is supposed to be the dog, but he is cut out too much, so he doesn''t really seem like he is.  Also the sky and the roof are blown out, there is no detail there it is just pure white.  I think I would try to straighten it out a bit too.', '2007-10-17 12:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4175141, 600974, 85155, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I think you meant to rotate this picture, I haven''t seen many towers like this that go left instead of up.  I like how nice and blue the sky is.</td>', 'Hmm... I think you meant to rotate this picture, I haven''t seen many towers like this that go left instead of up.  I like how nice and blue the sky is.', '2007-10-17 12:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
