(4175174, 601191, 85155, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea here, very unique.  The subject that the photographer is looking at isn''t that interesting to me though, and the composition could be better, but all in all this is a nice shot.</td>', 'I really like the idea here, very unique.  The subject that the photographer is looking at isn''t that interesting to me though, and the composition could be better, but all in all this is a nice shot.', '2007-10-17 12:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
