(4181471, 600509, 83328, '<td valign="top">nice image, i like the two subjects and the lines leading into the frame. Although it looks a little overprocessed, there seems to be halos everywhere.</td>', 'nice image, i like the two subjects and the lines leading into the frame. Although it looks a little overprocessed, there seems to be halos everywhere.', '2007-10-19 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
