(4181476, 600707, 83328, '<td valign="top">nice image, what are the walls/sides madde out of? they almost look like mirrors. I like the off-center perspective, although it seems like the person is not sharp, but instead the walls closer to the camera.</td>', 'nice image, what are the walls/sides madde out of? they almost look like mirrors. I like the off-center perspective, although it seems like the person is not sharp, but instead the walls closer to the camera.', '2007-10-19 17:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4181484, 599639, 83328, '<td valign="top">nice confusing image, I''m not sure what i''m looking at but i like it. I like the depth of field used and how focused and out of focus areas overlap. How did you do this?</td>', 'nice confusing image, I''m not sure what i''m looking at but i like it. I like the depth of field used and how focused and out of focus areas overlap. How did you do this?', '2007-10-19 17:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4181494, 599363, 83328, '<td valign="top">The sky seems empty and there''s too much of it. A closer crop at the top would have focused the attention on the subjects a little more. Maybe a closer crop at the top with the person a few steps closer to the camera would help so that the umbrella doesn''t interefere with the building. Just my opinion :-)</td>', 'The sky seems empty and there''s too much of it. A closer crop at the top would have focused the attention on the subjects a little more. Maybe a closer crop at the top with the person a few steps closer to the camera would help so that the umbrella doesn''t interefere with the building. Just my opinion :-)', '2007-10-19 17:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4181498, 599681, 83328, '<td valign="top">nice abstract, i like the lines in the frame</td>', 'nice abstract, i like the lines in the frame', '2007-10-19 17:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4181503, 598489, 83328, '<td valign="top">nice high contrast</td>', 'nice high contrast', '2007-10-19 17:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
