(4183443, 600041, 70000, '<td valign="top">This just makes me wonder why a woman in heels is on a metal latter, the lighting here is ind of harsh and the background being blown out makes it just kind of unappealing.</td>', 'This just makes me wonder why a woman in heels is on a metal latter, the lighting here is ind of harsh and the background being blown out makes it just kind of unappealing.', '2007-10-20 17:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183447, 601119, 70000, '<td valign="top">nice dynamic between the two horses</td>', 'nice dynamic between the two horses', '2007-10-20 17:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183451, 599224, 70000, '<td valign="top">really neat shot, different and interesting I like it</td>', 'really neat shot, different and interesting I like it', '2007-10-20 18:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183461, 600317, 70000, '<td valign="top">Great use of texture and line. The point of view isn''t anything very unique but this is still a beautiful shot</td>', 'Great use of texture and line. The point of view isn''t anything very unique but this is still a beautiful shot', '2007-10-20 18:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183464, 600056, 70000, '<td valign="top">wonderful focus</td>', 'wonderful focus', '2007-10-20 18:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183465, 601047, 70000, '<td valign="top">great use of lighting</td>', 'great use of lighting', '2007-10-20 18:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183488, 601167, 18197, '<td valign="top">Nice innovative photo. Great focus and contrast. Don''t care for the border effect. Goofy title.</td>', 'Nice innovative photo. Great focus and contrast. Don''t care for the border effect. Goofy title.', '2007-10-20 18:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183489, 600946, 85649, '<td valign="top">feels over-edited - even if in bounds of basic editing, definitely not in the spirit of it...</td>', 'feels over-edited - even if in bounds of basic editing, definitely not in the spirit of it...', '2007-10-20 18:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183491, 601125, 85649, '<td valign="top">unfortunately the main feature is out of focus - action shots can be difficult with focus... best bet is to manually focus when you know the place where the action is going to pass through... trial and error</td>', 'unfortunately the main feature is out of focus - action shots can be difficult with focus... best bet is to manually focus when you know the place where the action is going to pass through... trial and error', '2007-10-20 18:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183494, 601250, 85649, '<td valign="top">i like the concept. i think it may look better horizontally oriented. plus, it looks like you lightened up the shoe''s sole by the high concentration of grain in an otherwise clean photo - i think the sole would look better very dark than light and grainy...</td>', 'i like the concept. i think it may look better horizontally oriented. plus, it looks like you lightened up the shoe''s sole by the high concentration of grain in an otherwise clean photo - i think the sole would look better very dark than light and grainy...', '2007-10-20 18:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183496, 601105, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. Colors, focus, reflection, symetry ... and the title works for me.</td>', 'Lovely photo. Colors, focus, reflection, symetry ... and the title works for me.', '2007-10-20 18:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183497, 601198, 85649, '<td valign="top">the subtitle is more exciting than the photograph. if you have to get a back of the head shot, try incorporating more space so we can "see" whatthe bird is looking at - the turned-away head isn''t engaging on its own.</td>', 'the subtitle is more exciting than the photograph. if you have to get a back of the head shot, try incorporating more space so we can "see" whatthe bird is looking at - the turned-away head isn''t engaging on its own.', '2007-10-20 18:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183505, 599508, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very funny, but the camera doesn''t really appear to be inside the refrigerator. That appears to be the effect you''re reaching for, and it''s not a bad attempt.</td>', 'Very funny, but the camera doesn''t really appear to be inside the refrigerator. That appears to be the effect you''re reaching for, and it''s not a bad attempt.', '2007-10-20 18:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183511, 600464, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Why the red shadows, though? Is it reflected from the scorpion, or is it lighted with red lights?</td>', 'Interesting. Why the red shadows, though? Is it reflected from the scorpion, or is it lighted with red lights?', '2007-10-20 18:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183513, 601194, 12733, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a mushroom cloud than a head. And the water seems to be clearly on a different plane from what it is allegedly falling on.</td>', 'Looks more like a mushroom cloud than a head. And the water seems to be clearly on a different plane from what it is allegedly falling on.', '2007-10-20 18:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183516, 600125, 12733, '<td valign="top">The mirror point of view is a bit of a cliche, but it''s very well done.</td>', 'The mirror point of view is a bit of a cliche, but it''s very well done.', '2007-10-20 18:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183517, 601169, 12733, '<td valign="top">great capture of the night lighting.</td>', 'great capture of the night lighting.', '2007-10-20 18:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183528, 598843, 83577, '<td valign="top">The same way as Tom</td>', 'The same way as Tom', '2007-10-20 18:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183531, 600512, 83577, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2007-10-20 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4183534, 600813, 83312, '<td valign="top">cool idea but that blood looks so fake haha</td>', 'cool idea but that blood looks so fake haha', '2007-10-20 18:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
