(4186887, 598802, 46119, '<td valign="top">Nice enough shot but appears quite a soft focus which doesn''t seem intentional to me ..</td>', 'Nice enough shot but appears quite a soft focus which doesn''t seem intentional to me ..', '2007-10-22 09:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186897, 600366, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job.</td>', 'Great job.', '2007-10-22 09:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186899, 600861, 53147, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape. I am not sure if it truly is but it seems to be tilting to the left. A generally pleasing image but maybe not enough wow power to score big.</td>', 'Nice landscape. I am not sure if it truly is but it seems to be tilting to the left. A generally pleasing image but maybe not enough wow power to score big.', '2007-10-22 09:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186900, 601251, 53147, '<td valign="top">The power lines offer good lines (i guess thats a duh) but the image overall is a bit lacking. It doesnt grab my attention.</td>', 'The power lines offer good lines (i guess thats a duh) but the image overall is a bit lacking. It doesnt grab my attention.', '2007-10-22 09:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186902, 601161, 53147, '<td valign="top">This is pretty cool. Made me a bit woozy when I first opened it up, but it is effective. Cool perspective and the red and purple bring a strong point of interest to it.</td>', 'This is pretty cool. Made me a bit woozy when I first opened it up, but it is effective. Cool perspective and the red and purple bring a strong point of interest to it.', '2007-10-22 09:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186903, 599934, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good clean portrait with nice lighting. Not a wow shot but pleasing none the less.</td>', 'Good clean portrait with nice lighting. Not a wow shot but pleasing none the less.', '2007-10-22 09:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186904, 600386, 53147, '<td valign="top">I love the tilt and the wide angle distortion works well. Would love to see this in color.</td>', 'I love the tilt and the wide angle distortion works well. Would love to see this in color.', '2007-10-22 09:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186908, 600469, 53147, '<td valign="top">An entertaining shot in an odd way I guess. Not sure how else to comment on it. Decent detail but not much wow impact to it.</td>', 'An entertaining shot in an odd way I guess. Not sure how else to comment on it. Decent detail but not much wow impact to it.', '2007-10-22 09:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186909, 599350, 53147, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Just wish it "popped" a bit more. Not really sure how to do that, so this comment probably isnt really helpful. It just feels a bit flat.</td>', 'Good idea. Just wish it "popped" a bit more. Not really sure how to do that, so this comment probably isnt really helpful. It just feels a bit flat.', '2007-10-22 09:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186911, 601010, 53147, '<td valign="top">Would love to see this in color. The limb is interesting in itself but not sure this works overall.</td>', 'Would love to see this in color. The limb is interesting in itself but not sure this works overall.', '2007-10-22 09:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4186912, 601198, 53147, '<td valign="top">This shot doesnt grab me. A bit flat and on the uninteresting side.</td>', 'This shot doesnt grab me. A bit flat and on the uninteresting side.', '2007-10-22 09:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187031, 601133, 58380, '<td valign="top">the more i look at it, the more it looks like it is leaning to the right. other then that .. amazing shot! who''s point of view is it. the alcoholic''s after they have fallen on the floor? haha that would make sense why it is leaning to the right.. right ? haha</td>', 'the more i look at it, the more it looks like it is leaning to the right. other then that .. amazing shot! who''s point of view is it. the alcoholic''s after they have fallen on the floor? haha that would make sense why it is leaning to the right.. right ? haha', '2007-10-22 10:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187034, 598843, 58380, '<td valign="top">the same way you got where you were ? haha</td>', 'the same way you got where you were ? haha', '2007-10-22 11:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187098, 600595, 85718, '<td valign="top">this photo is very good. <br/>i like the how the photographer captured the tigers actions.<br/>10!</td>', 'this photo is very good. i like the how the photographer captured the tigers actions.10!', '2007-10-22 11:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187133, 600811, 66414, '<td valign="top">The sharpness of the landing gear is an attractive part of the subject, however I find this photo a little too obviously rotated.  The landing gear is deployed suggesting that the plane is landing or just took off and has been rotated.</td>', 'The sharpness of the landing gear is an attractive part of the subject, however I find this photo a little too obviously rotated.  The landing gear is deployed suggesting that the plane is landing or just took off and has been rotated.', '2007-10-22 11:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187135, 599668, 66414, '<td valign="top">I find the white object in the background a little distracting.  It doesn''t seem to add anything to the shot or if it is supposed to it doesn''t seem obvious to me.</td>', 'I find the white object in the background a little distracting.  It doesn''t seem to add anything to the shot or if it is supposed to it doesn''t seem obvious to me.', '2007-10-22 11:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187140, 600509, 66414, '<td valign="top">I like the post-processing effect, but find it a little to harsh for my liking.  I think it would make a good album cover!</td>', 'I like the post-processing effect, but find it a little to harsh for my liking.  I think it would make a good album cover!', '2007-10-22 11:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187143, 601203, 66414, '<td valign="top">Great shot, the leaf is fairly clear considering the situation and the almost uniform colour of the background just works well.  Good work!</td>', 'Great shot, the leaf is fairly clear considering the situation and the almost uniform colour of the background just works well.  Good work!', '2007-10-22 11:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187151, 601125, 66414, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, this is for sure not a point of view not many people see.  The skateboarders intense concentration on the land spot is also something different.  Hopefully it was far enough away from the photographer!</td>', 'Nice photo, this is for sure not a point of view not many people see.  The skateboarders intense concentration on the land spot is also something different.  Hopefully it was far enough away from the photographer!', '2007-10-22 11:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187155, 598859, 66414, '<td valign="top">It would have been nice to see the eyes of the woman.  I think not having them visible takes away from an otherwise good photo</td>', 'It would have been nice to see the eyes of the woman.  I think not having them visible takes away from an otherwise good photo', '2007-10-22 12:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187158, 600003, 66414, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, it almost makes me wonder if this is a second before your camera got soaked by the incoming wave.  Two minor things I would have changed though, get rid of the sensor dust, just left of centre and either wait a few minutes or clone out the jet trail.</td>', 'I like this shot, it almost makes me wonder if this is a second before your camera got soaked by the incoming wave.  Two minor things I would have changed though, get rid of the sensor dust, just left of centre and either wait a few minutes or clone out the jet trail.', '2007-10-22 12:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187169, 599522, 66414, '<td valign="top">I find the background to washed out, and it difficult to focus on the subjects, the photo might work better by getting down low and focusing on one goose.  The use of a fill flash and faster shutter speed would likely allow for the goose and background to both be more appropriately exposed.</td>', 'I find the background to washed out, and it difficult to focus on the subjects, the photo might work better by getting down low and focusing on one goose.  The use of a fill flash and faster shutter speed would likely allow for the goose and background to both be more appropriately exposed.', '2007-10-22 12:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187173, 600940, 66414, '<td valign="top">Thats a hell of a good reflection!  I like the idea of letting the ripple let the viewer know it is a reflection.</td>', 'Thats a hell of a good reflection!  I like the idea of letting the ripple let the viewer know it is a reflection.', '2007-10-22 12:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4187223, 600647, 66515, '<td valign="top">Tough light to work with here. This does need some contrast adjustment as it rather "muddy" for lack of a better word. No blacks or white just muted grays. <br/> <br/>I really like the different view point though. I can''t recall a shot from this angle of the town. Where was this taken from?</td>', 'Tough light to work with here. This does need some contrast adjustment as it rather "muddy" for lack of a better word. No blacks or white just muted grays.  I really like the different view point though. I can''t recall a shot from this angle of the town. Where was this taken from?', '2007-10-22 12:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
