(4191332, 600366, 47205, '<td valign="top">Very, very, (did I say very enough?) awesome Sandy!!! Amazing shot from an amazing lady and well deserved finish, as it is a wonderful capture!!! You do this so well. Some day I hope I can grow to be as good as you...well done my friend and God Bless you and your family always! :-) <br/> <br/></td>', 'Very, very, (did I say very enough?) awesome Sandy!!! Amazing shot from an amazing lady and well deserved finish, as it is a wonderful capture!!! You do this so well. Some day I hope I can grow to be as good as you...well done my friend and God Bless you and your family always! :-)  ', '2007-10-24 02:26:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191353, 600366, 39110, '<td valign="top">Oh Sandy this is so fantastic couldnt have happened to nicer more talented person ;)</td>', 'Oh Sandy this is so fantastic couldnt have happened to nicer more talented person ;)', '2007-10-24 02:33:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191385, 600366, 32872, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Sandy!!  I am so happy for you.  You deserve the blue ribbon for this wonderful image.  I love your animal photos.  You have such a delightful way of capturing their expressions!  way to go!!!</td>', 'Congratulations Sandy!!  I am so happy for you.  You deserve the blue ribbon for this wonderful image.  I love your animal photos.  You have such a delightful way of capturing their expressions!  way to go!!!', '2007-10-24 02:48:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4191394, 601250, 66384, '<td valign="top">Jeffrey, the SC must have gotten their inspiration for the current challenge "From the Ground Up" from this shot. <br/> <br/>Very well done. You have given us a good image and a good laugh too. Thanks. I like the rotation of the shot, with the crown molding on the diagonals.</td>', 'Jeffrey, the SC must have gotten their inspiration for the current challenge "From the Ground Up" from this shot.  Very well done. You have given us a good image and a good laugh too. Thanks. I like the rotation of the shot, with the crown molding on the diagonals.', '2007-10-24 02:52:57.000000', NULL, 0),
