(4191524, 600366, 61318, '<td valign="top">You rock Sandy!  Every time I manage to find the time to come over to DPC, I always expect to see your name on the front page, and am always upset when I don''t.  But luckily, I see you there just frequently enough for me to not get too fussy about it.<br/> <br/>This is a fantastic shot, of course, and definitely has your trademark style.  I would have picked this out as yours the moment I saw it.<br/> <br/>Congrats Sandy.  You''re piling up quite a collection of ribbons there :)</td>', 'You rock Sandy!  Every time I manage to find the time to come over to DPC, I always expect to see your name on the front page, and am always upset when I don''t.  But luckily, I see you there just frequently enough for me to not get too fussy about it. This is a fantastic shot, of course, and definitely has your trademark style.  I would have picked this out as yours the moment I saw it. Congrats Sandy.  You''re piling up quite a collection of ribbons there :)', '2007-10-24 04:12:19.000000', NULL, 0),
