(4191533, 601047, 41337, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this great? What I see here is a man(kind) walking away, oblivious to the beauty that surrounds him. His wondrous machines fill the frame with pride while nature fills the remaining gaps. It''s now just a reflection, an echo of it''s former self yet it surrounds man, protecting him with unconditional love, a mother''s love, a gaia''s love to be sure. <br/> <br/>Had I voted this would have received my highest vote. Congrats on a wonderful image and a fine score to boot!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-10-24 03:31:06.</i></td>', 'Isn''t this great? What I see here is a man(kind) walking away, oblivious to the beauty that surrounds him. His wondrous machines fill the frame with pride while nature fills the remaining gaps. It''s now just a reflection, an echo of it''s former self yet it surrounds man, protecting him with unconditional love, a mother''s love, a gaia''s love to be sure.  Had I voted this would have received my highest vote. Congrats on a wonderful image and a fine score to boot!', '2007-10-24 04:27:15.000000', '2007-10-24 04:31:06.000000', 0),
