(4192336, 601022, 84363, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for the comments.  As for the comments on the gun looking ''plasticky'' thats because it is.  The gun is a Springfield Arms 9mm XD.  The guns frame is a composite resin.  The only thing that is metal is the barrel and the upper slide.  Everything else is....  well... not metal.  I was trying to get my hands and the gun to stand out from the body, but like everything else maybe that was a bad idea?</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for the comments.  As for the comments on the gun looking ''plasticky'' thats because it is.  The gun is a Springfield Arms 9mm XD.  The guns frame is a composite resin.  The only thing that is metal is the barrel and the upper slide.  Everything else is....  well... not metal.  I was trying to get my hands and the gun to stand out from the body, but like everything else maybe that was a bad idea?', '2007-10-24 11:11:39.000000', NULL, 0),
