(4198128, 600366, 82707, '<td valign="top">Fabulous &amp; funny!!!  Congrats on the blue!  You have a precious talent for capturing that perfect moment with animals.... but I have to ask... are you related to Dr Doolittle?</td>', 'Fabulous & funny!!!  Congrats on the blue!  You have a precious talent for capturing that perfect moment with animals.... but I have to ask... are you related to Dr Doolittle?', '2007-10-26 19:11:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198294, 600366, 20941, '<td valign="top">Can''t help but smile at this one!!! Great shot Sandy Big Congratulations on the BLUE!!!</td>', 'Can''t help but smile at this one!!! Great shot Sandy Big Congratulations on the BLUE!!!', '2007-10-26 20:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198462, 600366, 35720, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a well deserved blue ribbon Sandy! Awesome capture!</td>', 'Congrats on a well deserved blue ribbon Sandy! Awesome capture!', '2007-10-26 22:01:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198722, 601055, 60862, '<td valign="top">Man, this STILL messes with my mind, and I''ve been looking at it for a week and a half. :)  Congrats on a personal top 5!</td>', 'Man, this STILL messes with my mind, and I''ve been looking at it for a week and a half. :)  Congrats on a personal top 5!', '2007-10-27 00:36:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198728, 598503, 82707, '<td valign="top">Wow! Congratulations on your first ribbon!</td>', 'Wow! Congratulations on your first ribbon!', '2007-10-27 00:38:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4198817, 601151, 60862, '<td valign="top">This is very cute! I really like the crisp DOF - you nailed it from the shoulders forward.<br/> <br/>I''m guessing the low score is from people not feeling this shows a particular point of view.</td>', 'This is very cute! I really like the crisp DOF - you nailed it from the shoulders forward. I''m guessing the low score is from people not feeling this shows a particular point of view.', '2007-10-27 01:15:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199326, 600875, 61651, '<td valign="top">Title makes me smile :)  A peacock is just a peacock except when...well, it all does just depend on your point of view, doesn''t it?  The only thing that bothers me here is the frame - doesn''t seem to complement the image, to my eye.</td>', 'Title makes me smile :)  A peacock is just a peacock except when...well, it all does just depend on your point of view, doesn''t it?  The only thing that bothers me here is the frame - doesn''t seem to complement the image, to my eye.', '2007-10-27 11:36:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199328, 601119, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of pov, and I like how you framed it, choosing to put both horses in the composition.  The background horse sort of acts as a dynamic frame of reference for the foreground one.  If you had gone with just presenting us with those horsey legs, it likely would have been a less interesting comp.  The more I look at this the more I am impressed with your choice in framing the scene.</td>', 'Very effective use of pov, and I like how you framed it, choosing to put both horses in the composition.  The background horse sort of acts as a dynamic frame of reference for the foreground one.  If you had gone with just presenting us with those horsey legs, it likely would have been a less interesting comp.  The more I look at this the more I am impressed with your choice in framing the scene.', '2007-10-27 11:41:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199329, 600366, 25787, '<td valign="top">You did it again!!!  What a great shot Sandy.  Congratulations.</td>', 'You did it again!!!  What a great shot Sandy.  Congratulations.', '2007-10-27 11:43:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199330, 598812, 61651, '<td valign="top">Well my first thought was "zebra", then I saw the title and went "whaaa...?"  Very effective pov - you set the viewer to wondering!</td>', 'Well my first thought was "zebra", then I saw the title and went "whaaa...?"  Very effective pov - you set the viewer to wondering!', '2007-10-27 11:43:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199335, 601250, 61651, '<td valign="top">Looks like you chose the background well to complement your shot - I like how the ceiling moulding converges on you.  Great facial expression - the everyman''s "bug face"!</td>', 'Looks like you chose the background well to complement your shot - I like how the ceiling moulding converges on you.  Great facial expression - the everyman''s "bug face"!', '2007-10-27 11:46:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199364, 600875, 64568, '<td valign="top">lol, nice shot and great title</td>', 'lol, nice shot and great title', '2007-10-27 11:56:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199389, 598503, 34462, '<td valign="top">What an interesting POV. Congrats on your first ribbon.</td>', 'What an interesting POV. Congrats on your first ribbon.', '2007-10-27 12:09:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199396, 601119, 34462, '<td valign="top">Love the richness of the browns and the textures of the forward horse.</td>', 'Love the richness of the browns and the textures of the forward horse.', '2007-10-27 12:12:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199400, 600317, 34462, '<td valign="top">Love the textures, colors and then the framing of the eye. Congrats on a top 5.</td>', 'Love the textures, colors and then the framing of the eye. Congrats on a top 5.', '2007-10-27 12:14:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199407, 598637, 34462, '<td valign="top">Stunning photograph. It took a while for me to get my bearings.</td>', 'Stunning photograph. It took a while for me to get my bearings.', '2007-10-27 12:16:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199429, 601161, 34462, '<td valign="top">Love the read railing. Great shot and a wonderful POV</td>', 'Love the read railing. Great shot and a wonderful POV', '2007-10-27 12:24:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199437, 600561, 66384, '<td valign="top">I suspected this was yours -- it looks like Frankenmuth architecture. I like the point of view. I''d like to see more light on the front of the building. You might have been able to add fill light in the RAW conversion. Also you could try using Photoshop: filter&gt;render&gt;lighting effects&gt;Omni light. It''s not good for basic editing, but worth experimenting.</td>', 'I suspected this was yours -- it looks like Frankenmuth architecture. I like the point of view. I''d like to see more light on the front of the building. You might have been able to add fill light in the RAW conversion. Also you could try using Photoshop: filter>render>lighting effects>Omni light. It''s not good for basic editing, but worth experimenting.', '2007-10-27 12:26:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199460, 601057, 61651, '<td valign="top">Excellently chosen pov, IMO - maybe a perspective others might think of, but the choice of focus is not ordinary.  I really like this.</td>', 'Excellently chosen pov, IMO - maybe a perspective others might think of, but the choice of focus is not ordinary.  I really like this.', '2007-10-27 12:31:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199467, 601246, 61651, '<td valign="top">I think you were unfairly pounded in the scoring.  I believe this fits the challenge very well - gotta be a new pov to consider, for us humans - last time I checked we can''t usually walk upside down on things.  I like the toning and the overall quietness of the shot - it has the effect of highlighting the bug all the more and giving it a sense of poignancy.</td>', 'I think you were unfairly pounded in the scoring.  I believe this fits the challenge very well - gotta be a new pov to consider, for us humans - last time I checked we can''t usually walk upside down on things.  I like the toning and the overall quietness of the shot - it has the effect of highlighting the bug all the more and giving it a sense of poignancy.', '2007-10-27 12:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199468, 601119, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice knees. You captured a lot of personality in the background horse. He''s probably wondering why the crazy lady is rolling in that stuff. :P</td>', 'Nice knees. You captured a lot of personality in the background horse. He''s probably wondering why the crazy lady is rolling in that stuff. :P', '2007-10-27 12:37:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199471, 600513, 61651, '<td valign="top">This is really delightful. :)</td>', 'This is really delightful. :)', '2007-10-27 12:38:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199569, 600366, 28359, '<td valign="top">To funny. Great shot.....Congrats</td>', 'To funny. Great shot.....Congrats', '2007-10-27 14:27:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199586, 600366, 68504, '<td valign="top">Love the combination of perfection and improbable perspective which makes this so much more than cute. (Was no one there to take a candid of YOU taking this shot?)</td>', 'Love the combination of perfection and improbable perspective which makes this so much more than cute. (Was no one there to take a candid of YOU taking this shot?)', '2007-10-27 14:44:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199621, 598503, 85848, '<td valign="top">Superb POV.  And the b/w rendering is top-notch.</td>', 'Superb POV.  And the b/w rendering is top-notch.', '2007-10-27 15:30:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199624, 601161, 85848, '<td valign="top">A dizzying POV, very effective.  And the color &amp; exposure are perfect.</td>', 'A dizzying POV, very effective.  And the color & exposure are perfect.', '2007-10-27 15:34:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4199625, 600520, 85848, '<td valign="top">This is SO fine!  Way beyond the usual photo and into the category of "art."</td>', 'This is SO fine!  Way beyond the usual photo and into the category of "art."', '2007-10-27 15:36:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4200470, 598749, 67841, '<td valign="top">Nice one, Adam!  Congrats on a nice score...</td>', 'Nice one, Adam!  Congrats on a nice score...', '2007-10-28 00:25:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(4200475, 601203, 60910, '<td valign="top">this is one of the coolest shots i''ve seen in a very long time!!  what a fantastic bokeh capture, so creative, i just love it!</td>', 'this is one of the coolest shots i''ve seen in a very long time!!  what a fantastic bokeh capture, so creative, i just love it!', '2007-10-28 00:25:51.000000', NULL, 0),
